# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in at least one Client ID.
#
# SETTING UP A SPOTIFY APPLICATION
# 1. Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# 2. Enable the "Web API" and "Web Playback SDK" APIs for it.
# 3. Register these Redirect URIs, exactly as written:
#      http://127.0.0.1:5173/          (local development — `localhost` is rejected)
#      https://<user>.github.io/jtm-s/ (GitHub Pages, if you deploy there)
# 4. In the dashboard, add every Spotify account that should be able to log in
#    (Settings -> User Management). An app in development mode allows 5 accounts,
#    and its owner needs Premium for the app to work at all.
#
# SEVERAL APPLICATIONS
# Five accounts per application is the binding limit, so the build can carry up
# to five applications and the host picks one in Settings. Fill in as many as you
# need and leave the rest empty; an entry that is not 32 hexadecimal characters
# is ignored rather than offered.
#
# The number is fixed at five because Vite substitutes these names into the code
# while building, which only works for names written out in full — a loop over
# `VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID_${n}` would read as undefined at runtime.
#
# The name is optional and is only a label in Settings; without one the entry
# shows as "Application 1", "Application 2" and so on. Name them after whose
# accounts are on each allowlist — that is the thing you are really choosing
# between.
#
# Switching application in Settings logs you out of Spotify, because the stored
# tokens were issued to the application you are leaving.
#
# The Client ID is not a secret: the PKCE flow sends it in a visible URL and Vite
# inlines it into the built bundle. There is no client secret anywhere in this
# app, and none should ever be added. Keeping the IDs out of the repository is
# still worthwhile, which is why they live here and in GitHub Actions secrets.

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID_1=
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_NAME_1=

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID_2=
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_NAME_2=

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID_3=
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_NAME_3=

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID_4=
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_NAME_4=

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID_5=
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_NAME_5=
